# Who must have signed the `ocx` pinned in ocx.toml: `.github/actions/release-ocx` verifies the locked digest
# against this identity before it installs the pin. Swap both lines together with the pin when the released
# version replaces the dev build. Plain KEY=value lines, no quotes: the action reads them, it never sources them.
OCX_CERTIFICATE_IDENTITY=https://github.com/ocx-sh/ocx/.github/workflows/release.yml@refs/heads/hex/signing-dogfood
OCX_CERTIFICATE_OIDC_ISSUER=https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com
